    "stem": "A mother brings her child to the clinic for\nevaluation of frequent falls and\nprogressive dysarthria. Physical\nexamination reveals a staggering gait,\npes cavus, and kyphoscoliosis. Which\ntrinucleotide repeat is most likely\npresent in this patient?",
