    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 92,
    "stem": "A 10-year-old child presents with long\nfingers, chest wall deformity, and vision\nproblems. On eye exam, lens\ndislocation is noted, displaced\ndownward and toward the nose. Which\nof the following is the most likely\ndiagnosis?",
