    "stem": "A 22 year old male consults for ptosis and\ndiplopia which usually begins to occur in the\nlate afternoon and improves upon waking up\nafter a long good sleep. Recently he also noted\ndysphagia and muscle weakness which also\nimproves with rest. What is the\npathophysiology of his condition?",
