    "explanation": "Sickle cell anemia is the most common hereditary\nanemia in persons of African lineage. Leg ulcers and\nrecurring painful crises are characteristic. In sickle cell\nanemia, in contrast to sickle cell trait, sickle cells are\noften seen on the peripheral blood smear.",
