    "stem": "A 23-year-old woman presents with cervical\nand mediastinal lymphadenopathy. Biopsy of a\ncervical lymph node reveals a nodular\nappearance with fibrous bands, effacement of\nthe lymph node architecture, and numerous\nlacunar cells. Which of the following is\ncharacteristic of this disorder?",
