    "stem": "A 15-year-old boy presents with a pathologic\nfracture following a minor injury on the soccer\nfield. The area of fracture is surrounded by a\nlarge tumor which shows marked\npleomorphism, high mitotic activity, and\nextensive cartilaginous differentiation on\nmicroscopy. The most likely diagnosis is",
