    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 76,
    "stem": "On endoscopy of a 14 year old boy complaining\nof bleeding per rectum, a colonic mass was\nseen. Histologic examination demonstrates a\ncharacteristic arborizing network of connective\ntissue, smooth muscle, lamina propria, and\nglands lined by normal-appearing intestinal\nepithelium. What is the diagnosis?",
