    "explanation": "Page 112 of hand out. Mitral stenosis causes an\nincrease in LA size due to restriction of blood flow\nfrom the left atrium to the left ventricle as a result of a\nnarrowed mitral passage. Murmurs associated with\nMS are opening snap, accentuated S1, and diastolic\nrumble. Plain film chest xray findings are\ncardiomegaly, double right heart border (enlarged left\natrium and normal right atrium), prominent left atrial\nappendage and splaying of the subcarinal angle (>120\ndegrees).",
