    "stem": "A 42 y/o male presents with right abdominal\nmass associated with gross hematuria. He also\nhad episodes of diaphoresis and refractory\nhypertension. Imaging showed renal mass and\nadrenal medullary tumor. What is your primary\ndiagnosis?",
