    "correctChoice": "C",
    "explanation": "Von hippel lindau disease is a type of familial tumor\nsyndrome characterized by renal cell carcinoma,\npheochromocytoma and cerebellar\nhemangioblastoma. Sipple syndrome aka MEN type\nIIA is a triad of parathyroid hyperplasia, medullary\ncarcinoma, pheochromocytoma. Tuberous sclerosis is\nassociated with renal angiomyolipoma, retinal\nhamartoma,cortical tubers, cardiac rhabdomyoma,\nshagreen patches and ash leaf patch. Gorlin\nsyndrome.Li Fraumeni syndrome is caused by p53\nmutation and associated with sarcomas, breast cancer,\nadrenal cortical tumors, leukemia and gliomas.",
