    "stem": "A 28 y/o female veterinarian presents with 3\nweek history dry cough accompanied by low\ngrade fever and night sweats. CXR revealed\ncavitary lesion noted on bilateral lung apices.\nAFB showed negative for 3 specimen. PPD is\nalso negative. Which of the following is true\nregarding the most plausible diagnosis in this\ncase?",
