    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 268,
    "stem": "A 10 year old child presents to your clinic with\ncomplaints of dark urine, periorbital edema,\nmalaise, and body weakness. You elicit a history\nof throat infection 3 weeks prior. You expect\nwhich of the following pathological lesion for\nthis type of hypersensitivity reaction:",
