    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 270,
    "stem": "You are assigned to assist a transplant surgeon\nwho will be performing a kidney transplant. In\norder to prepare yourself for possible questions\nthat you may be asked during the surgery, you\nrecall your pathology knowledge.You know that\nchronic rejection will be characterized by:",
