    "stem": "A 65 year old woman with a heavy smoking\nhistory presents with chronic productive cough\nthat has been present for 3 consecutive months\nover the past 2 years. On PE, she is noted to be\noverweight with a bluish tinge to her skin.\nAuscultation revealed rhonchi on both lung\nfields. Which of the following is the most likely\nhistologic finding in this patient's airways?",
