    "stem": "An 18 year old male presented with swelling of\nthe left knee, an X-ray was done which showed\nlytic lesions over the said area. A biopsy was\ndone which showed an abundance of\nmultinucleated giant cells with background of\nmononuclear stromal cells. What is the most\nlikely diagnosis for this case?",
