    "explanation": "Osteoclastoma or giant cell tumor involve both the\nepihyses and metaphyses. The majority arise in the\nknee. The typical location causes arthritis like\nsymptoms. Biopsy of the tumor will reveal an\nabundance of multinucleated giant cells with\nbackground of mononuclear stromal cells",
