    "id": "superexam-pathology-0306",
    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 306,
    "stem": "A 65 y/o male went for consult secondary,\nfever, chronic malaise, and weight loss. Upon\nphysical examination, multiple\nlymphadenophathies were noted on the\noropharyngeal area. hepatosplenomegaly is\nalso noted. Biopsy of the lymph node showed\ngeneralized effacement of sinusoid structure by\nsheets of large cells 4-5x the size of a normal\nlymphocyte. which of the following is true\nabout the diagnosis ?",
