    "id": "superexam-pathology-0364",
    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 364,
    "stem": "A 60/F who has recurrent fever, fatigue, weight\nloss, cough and night sweats came to you for\nconsult. You ordered chest xray which showed\nenlarged hilar lymph nodes and multiple 1-2\ncm non-cavitating lesions. Biopsy of the lesions\nwas done showing non-caseating granulomata\nwith fibrosis. The most probable diagnosis is:",
