    "stem": "A 58 year-old male, hypertensive was rushed to\nthe Emergency Room due to loss of\nconsciousness. His son recalled that his father\nsuddenly complained of very severe headache\nafter their breakfast followed by loss of\nconsciousness. What is the most probable\ndiagnosis?",
