    "stem": "A pigeon raiser suddenly developed stiff neck\nand deteriorating sensorium was rushed to the\nER and was admitted. Work-up was done for\nprobable diagnosis. Lumbar puncture was done\nand CSF was obtained and should be stained\nwith:",
