    "id": "superexam-pathology-0450",
    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 450,
    "stem": "A 55 year-old man was suffering from recurrent\nattacks of persistent cough. He was rushed to\nthe Emergency Room due to severe defficulty of\nbreathing. PE revealed wheezes over lung\nfields. Mucous plugs were collected and\nhistologically examined revealing collections of\ncystalloid made up of eosinophil membrane\nprotein. These are:",
