    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 461,
    "stem": "A 7 year old boy presents with pallor and\nrecurrent fever. CBC showed increased WBC\nand decreased RBC. Bone marrow analysis\nshowed hypercellularity with predominance of\nlymphoblasts, MPO negative, PAS positive, TDT\nand CALLA positive. What is not true of this\ndisease?",
