    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 475,
    "stem": "A 45 year old female sought consultation to a\nsurgeon due to a mass on the upper outer\nquadrant of her Right breast. The surgeon\ndecided to have biopsy of the mass which\nrevealed a dyscohesive infiltrating tumor cells\narranged in single file or in sheets.",
