    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 480,
    "stem": "A 37 year old female has a salmon-colored\nplaques on her elbows, knees, and scalp with\nadherent silvery-white scales. Upon scratching\nthe lesion, pinpoint bleeding was noted. Which\nof the following is true:",
