    "stem": "A 5-year-old female presents with a new onset\nhematuria and oliguria after 1 week of\nexperiencing sore throat. Other pertinent\nfindings revealed hypertension, periorbital\nedema and impaired renal function. A renal\nbiopsy most likely would reveal electron-dense\ndeposits in which of the following sites?",
