    "originalNumber": 537,
    "stem": "A 32-year-old female was noted to have a\nbreast mass with axillary lymph node\nenlargement. Further work ups, revealed that\nthe mass was cancerous. A diagnosis of invasive\nductal carcinoma was made. Modified radical\nmastectomy was done with axillary lymph node\ndissection. Pathological examination of the\naxillary lymph nodes will show?",
