    "stem": "40 year old male has had recurrent episodes of\nepigastric pain for the past 3 weeks, relieved by\neating. He had an endoscopy with biopsy done.\nWhich of the following is true regarding the\nexpected histologic picture of the gastric biopsy\nspecimen?",
