    "stem": "A 23-year old medical student who had\novernight binge drinking suddenly developed\nboring abdominal pain relieved by doubling up.\nSerum amylase and lipase were elevated. What\ntype of necrosis occurs when pancreatic lipases\nwere released in the substance of the pancreas\nand peritoneal cavity?",
