    "stem": "A 30-year old male had recurrent diarrhea,\ncrampy abdominal pain, and fever for 3 months.\nColonoscopy done showed areas of long\nserpentine linear ulcers oriented along the axis\nof the bowel with surrounding mucosal sparing.\nBiopsy of the lesion will show?",
