    "stem": "A 5 year old male developed a demyelinating\nneuropathy associated with Campylobacter\njejuni. He presents clinically with ascending\nneuromuscular paralysis and areflexia. He was\nthen treated with plasmapharesis, IV\nimmunoglobulins and corticosteroids. The\ndiagnosis to this case belongs to what type of\nhypersensitivity?",
