    "stem": "A 20-year old female presented with malar\nrash, oral ulcers, protosensitivity and\nproteinuria with granules or casts, kidney\nbiopsy was done showing a \"wire loop\nabnormality\" on light microscope with marked\nsubendothelial immune complex deposition on\nelectron microscope. What is the diagnosis?",
